
# ============================================
# The shared UI, built.
#
# ⚠️ BUILT ON THE BUILD MACHINE, NOT COMMITTED.
#
# `assets/shell/index.html` is a 4.5 MB artifact of `packages/app-shell`.
# Committing it would put a build output in git that silently goes stale the
# moment anybody edits the shared UI — and the mobile app would then ship a
# different version of the product than web and desktop, which is the exact
# drift this architecture removed. EAS rebuilds it in `eas-build-post-install`.
# ============================================
assets/shell/

# The same build output, at its Android path.
android/app/src/main/assets/shell/
